\label{lemma-cohomology-bounded-below}
Let $\mathcal{A}$ be an abelian category.
Let $K^\bullet$ be a complex of $\mathcal{A}$.
\begin{enumerate}
\item If $K^\bullet$ has an injective resolution then
$H^n(K^\bullet) = 0$ for $n \ll 0$.
