consisting of right acyclic objects for $F$,
\item for $E \in D(\mathcal{A})$
\begin{enumerate}
\item $H^i(RF(\tau_{\leq a}E) \to H^i(RF(E))$ is an isomorphism
for $i \leq a$,
\item $H^i(RF(E)) \to H^i(RF(\tau_{\geq b - n + 1}E))$ is an isomorphism
